147 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The AEC industry operates with numerous stakeholders \(architects, engineers, contractors, clients, suppliers\) working in silos, often using different tools and processes. This lack of real-time, centralized collaboration results in miscommunication, conflicting decisions, and inefficiencies in workflows. These inefficiencies drive design errors, time delays, and cost overruns, especially as projects scale in complexity.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
