<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Errors or discrepancies that arise during the construction phase are exponentially more costly and time-consuming to address than if they were resolved earlier. Current tools and workflows lack real-time validation mechanisms to catch and resolve these issues during the design phase, resulting in material wastage, budget overruns, and delayed delivery.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
