/S /P
/E (Material selection relies on physical samples, mockups, and catalogs, which are time-consuming, resource-intensive, and poorly integrated into design workflows. This inefficiency leads to delays in decision-making, increased costs, and limited experimentation, ultimately slowing down the execution of projects and impacting quality.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [8]
>>
